WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.706
Eleven shortcuts to

00:00:01.517 --> 00:00:02.885
fly around Xcode

00:00:03.414 --> 00:00:04.404
The guide opens

00:00:04.216 --> 00:00:05.607
with Shift Command

00:00:05.702 --> 00:00:06.963
O Open Quickly

00:00:06.869 --> 00:00:07.635
which finds a

00:00:07.447 --> 00:00:08.543
file by name

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:09.439
and even takes

00:00:09.251 --> 00:00:10.147
a line number

00:00:10.006 --> 00:00:10.689
when a bug

00:00:10.501 --> 00:00:11.468
report points to

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:11.810
one

00:00:12.334 --> 00:00:13.760
Control Command

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:14.951
Left and Right

00:00:14.763 --> 00:00:15.954
arrows move back

00:00:15.766 --> 00:00:16.650
and forward through

00:00:16.461 --> 00:00:17.852
your navigation history

00:00:18.077 --> 00:00:18.619
so you can

00:00:18.431 --> 00:00:19.303
follow a chain

00:00:19.115 --> 00:00:20.234
of definitions and

00:00:20.046 --> 00:00:20.848
return

00:00:21.374 --> 00:00:22.635
Other picks include

00:00:22.447 --> 00:00:23.555
Control 6 for

00:00:23.367 --> 00:00:24.428
the document-items

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:24.852
menu

00:00:25.065 --> 00:00:26.232
Shift Command J

00:00:26.044 --> 00:00:26.774
to reveal a

00:00:26.586 --> 00:00:27.258
file in the

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:27.930
navigator

00:00:28.013 --> 00:00:29.345
and Option-click for

00:00:29.157 --> 00:00:29.958
Quick Help

00:00:30.486 --> 00:00:31.500
Full story on

00:00:31.311 --> 00:00:32.207
the dashboard
